    <section class="references" id="sect-00013">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00032">Alhumaid, M. M., &amp; Said, M. A. (2023). Increased physical activity, higher educational attainment, and the use of mobility aid are associated with self-esteem in people with physical disabilities. <emphasis effect="italics">Frontiers in Psychology</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">14</emphasis>. https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2023.1072709</para>
